OnAiTalk
{
	if CHAIN.IDName != ""
	{
		LastTalk = ChainTalk
	}
	else
	{
		LastTalk = RandomTalk
	}
	LastTalk
}

RandomTalk : nonoverlap_pool
{
	if testing
	{
		{
			OnRandomClassmate
			"\0\s[neutral]Today in my %(classes) class, %(rName) got caught %(mischief).\w9\n\n\s[eep]The teacher's scary when she's angry..."
		}

	}
	else
	{
		// === Friday Dialogue ===

		if weekday == 5
		{
			"\0\s[excited]It's Friday! Amanda and I are gonna watch a movie marathon!"
		}
		
		// === Saturday/Weekend Dialogue ===
		if weekday == 6
		{
			"\0\s[starry]Iiiit's time for Saturday morning cartoons!!!"
		}

		if weekday == 6 || weekday == 7
		{
			"\0\s[excited]Weekend!!"
		}

		
		// === Holiday & Seasonal Dialogue ===
		// if _today == "10/31" {}
		// if _today == "12/25" {}
		// if _today == "12/31" {}
		// if _today == "1/1" {}
		// if _today == "2/14" {}


		// === Schoolwork Stuff ===
		"\0\s[happy]I took chemistry this year for my science classes. Milovan's dad does some alchemy stuff sometimes, and I know they're not the same thing, but I thought it'd be cool to learn since there might be some similarities.\w7\s[excited]\n\n[half]I wanna do cool alchemy magic one day!"

		"\0\s[tired]Hrrmm...\nI still have a bunch of homework to do."
		
		"\0\s[neutral]A lot of my classmates complain about math subjects, but I like them. Once I know the formula, I just have to follow the steps. It's easier than book reports and stuff, I think."

		// === Amanda & Classmates ===
		// "\0\s[neutral]Today in my precalculus class, Ayako got caught passing notes to the girl next to her.\w9\n\n\s[eep]The teacher's scary when she's angry..."
		{
			OnRandomClassmate
			"\0\s[neutral]Today in my %(classes) class, %(rName) got caught %(mischief).\w9\n\n\s[eep]The teacher's scary when she's angry..."
		}

		// === Evercotts & the Bookstore ===
		"\0\s[starry]On my birthday or sometimes on the holidays, Milovan and his family let me pick out a free book from their bookstore."
		
		"\0\s[think]I guess Mr. Evercott has a few regulars who order alchemy commissions from him sometimes. Or potions or other things.\w9\s[think] I wanna order something one day, but it's expensive."
		
		"\0\s[starry]I stopped by the book store after school the other day. I got the next book in the Haunted Tales series! It's the third one, I'm still catching up.\n\nI like them a lot so far though. Very spooky."

		// "\0\s[tired]I'm never sure what I should call Milovan's mom. She's not technically a \"Mrs.\" Evercott because her and Mr. Evercott aren't actually married. But if she's \"Miss\" or \"Ms.\" Evercott, that's confusing, because that's also her sister...\w8\w8\n\nI know none of them mind if I call them by name but that feels weird too..."

		// === Misc ===
		"\0\s[neutral]You'd think I'd be a senior instead of a junior because of my age, but I actually started school when I was six years old instead of five.\w8\n\n\s[surprise]And you'd think Amanda would be older than me! She looks older, doesn't she?"
		
		// "\0\s[unamused]It weirds me out whenever someone calls me by my full name.\n\n\"Beatrice\" just sounds too... \f[bold,true]old lady.\f[bold,default]\w8\w8\n\n\s[eep]Uh. No offense to old ladies, though."
	//	"User info from SSP preferences: %(username) %(they) %(them) %(their) %(theirs) %(themself)"
	}
}